<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Online Sticker Maker</p>

      <h1>Sticker Maker Online</h1>

      <p>
        Create AI stickers online from text prompts or portraits. Generate one sticker, run a small
        batch, retry failed prompts, and download the finished files from your sticker history.
      </p>
       <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">Open Sticker Maker</a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Prompt based stickers</h2>

        <p>
          Write a simple idea, choose a clear subject, and keep the style focused for cleaner sticker results.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Batch workflow</h2>

        <p>
          Add one prompt per line to create a small batch, then track progress and failed items in history.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Download options</h2>

        <p>
          Use original, PNG, or WebP downloads depending on whether you need editing support or smaller web files.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Online sticker maker workflow</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>
          Start with text to sticker when you have an idea, object, mascot, or reaction prompt.
        </li>

        <li>Use face to sticker when you want an avatar-style sticker from a portrait.</li>

        <li>
          Track processing and failed stickers in history, then retry or cancel when needed.
        </li>

        <li>Select completed stickers and download single files or batch ZIP packages.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Sticker maker prompt examples</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>friendly robot mascot sticker, blue accents, clean white border</code>
        <code>cute flower character smiling, simple background, sticker icon style</code>
        <code>travel airplane mascot, happy expression, bold outline, social sticker</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>What makes a good online sticker?</h2>

      <p>
        A good AI sticker has one clear subject, a readable silhouette, simple colors, and a
        specific emotion or use case. Avoid overloaded prompts with too many subjects. If a result
        misses the idea, regenerate with fewer details and stronger sticker words.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/face-to-sticker"}>Face to Sticker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/transparent-sticker-maker"}>Download Formats</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/cute-sticker-ideas"}>Sticker Ideas</.link>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
